\ A brace's error in a have-by inside try, after a step (review
\ tb2-blocks3 finding 1; as the whole body it would log, 490):
\ thrown, and try takes the have back, so j is unknown after it: Lean's
\ "Unknown identifier `j`", LeanForth's own 76 (a name the goal's context
\ lacks; it was 490 before). Lean twin w_try_brace in blocks-3-wrong.lean.
theorem w_try_brace
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b = explicit: h  b a = explicit: k
  a b =
:= by
  by-try b a = by-have-by: j b a = by-show { ' h by-exact } by-end by-end
  ' j by-exact
end w_try_brace
